- Soo Gyom, you’re here
- Hello

179
00:10:39.514 --> 00:10:40.557
- Go get ready.
- OK

180
00:10:52.527 --> 00:10:53.653
Auntie, I put it here

181
00:10:53.736 --> 00:10:54.863
Good

182
00:10:57.866 --> 00:10:59.701
Su Qian, hurry up and pack up and go back.

183
00:10:59.784 --> 00:11:00.952
Good bye

184
00:11:01.035 --> 00:11:01.911
Goodbye

185
00:11:05.456 --> 00:11:07.876
(Export)

186
00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:22.724
Is this the career you said you wanted to do together?

187
00:11:23.808 --> 00:11:24.934
I have to go in

188
00:11:25.018 --> 00:11:27.937
Didn't we prove that we are capable?

189
00:11:28.605 --> 00:11:30.690
I know you don't want to rely on your dad...

190
00:11:30.773 --> 00:11:33.776
My dad said he would give me the money, but I said he wouldn’t want it.

191
00:11:34.611 --> 00:11:35.486
Why?

192
00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:36.613
No why

193
00:11:38.698 --> 00:11:40.658
Since he said he would give you money, just accept it.

194
00:11:40.742 --> 00:11:42.911
You can give it back to him later

195
00:11:42.994 --> 00:11:44.829
What's wrong with this?

196
00:11:47.707 --> 00:11:48.666
Hello

197
00:11:49.834 --> 00:11:51.252
What did my dad do wrong?

198
00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:53.046
What?

199
00:11:53.129 --> 00:11:55.089
Why does my dad have to invest in us?

200
00:11:55.173 --> 00:11:56.299
you can...

201
00:11:57.967 --> 00:12:00.345
You can ask your parents for help.

202
00:12:02.639 --> 00:12:04.933
When did I ask your dad to invest in us?

203
00:12:05.016 --> 00:12:07.352
Was it me who suggested borrowing money from your father?

204
00:12:07.435 --> 00:12:09.520
That's not true. But what's going on with your attitude?

205
00:12:10.063 --> 00:12:11.981
Who do you think got me into this mess?

206
00:12:16.611 --> 00:12:17.779
Blame me again?

207
00:12:18.696 --> 00:12:21.407
