211
00:12:39.259 --> 00:12:42.512
Here, take this money first

212
00:12:43.137 --> 00:12:44.305
I'll call you the rest later

213
00:12:44.389 --> 00:12:46.057
- Hannah
- I thought about it

214
00:12:46.140 --> 00:12:47.350
I'm going back to the United States

215
00:12:47.433 --> 00:12:51.938
We should really put everything
Stay in the beautiful memories of middle school

216
00:12:54.565 --> 00:12:55.900
Sorry Soo Gyom

217
00:12:57.193 --> 00:12:58.569
I messed everything up

218
00:12:59.195 --> 00:13:01.239
I'll tell my parents as soon as I get back

219
00:13:01.322 --> 00:13:02.407
Send you the money

220
00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:04.784
It won't be long. Take care.

221
00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:22.468
I thought we were going to grill our own meat

222
00:13:22.552 --> 00:13:24.637
No, they will help with everything.

223
00:13:25.888 --> 00:13:26.931
thank you

224
00:13:27.557 --> 00:13:30.226
It’s not quite what we thought of camping.

225
00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:32.437
- Right
- I really should have brought Soo-gyeom with me.

226
00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:34.397
