- thank you

227
00:13:37.483 --> 00:13:38.901
Brother-in-law, you have worked hard these years

228
00:13:38.985 --> 00:13:39.861
Don't do this

229
00:13:39.944 --> 00:13:42.739
I wish you good health in the second act of your life

230
00:13:43.614 --> 00:13:45.366
Congratulations, brother-in-law

231
00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:47.535
- I wish you a prosperous career
- thank you

232
00:13:48.661 --> 00:13:51.539
But why did you resign?

233
00:13:54.208 --> 00:13:55.335
Nothing interesting anymore

234
00:13:55.418 --> 00:13:58.254
Want to try a new way of living

235
00:13:58.338 --> 00:14:01.924
Many companies have already invited him to work

236
00:14:02.008 --> 00:14:03.384
Of course

237
00:14:03.468 --> 00:14:06.095
After all, my brother-in-law has worked in a large company for 25 years.

238
00:14:08.097 --> 00:14:11.142
I recently hired a sales director

239
00:14:11.225 --> 00:14:12.518
It took a lot of effort

240
00:14:12.602 --> 00:14:14.437
After all, I always take you as the standard in my heart

241
00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:16.189
Everyone seems to think it's funny

242
00:14:17.982 --> 00:14:19.359
Really?

243
00:14:22.612 --> 00:14:25.573
If you want to open a company, you have to recruit people.

244
00:14:26.199 --> 00:14:28.242
What will the brother-in-law do next?

245
00:14:28.326 --> 00:14:29.660
Any plans?

246
00:14:29.744 --> 00:14:31.704
The severance pay shouldn't be much, I guess.

247
00:14:33.539 --> 00:14:34.916
more than you think

248
00:14:37.210 --> 00:14:39.587
Oops, you are really worrying so much.

249
00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:42.090
My brother-in-law must have a plan, right?

250
00:14:42.173 --> 00:14:43.508
- Right
- So

251
00:14:43.591 --> 00:14:46.094
I want to know what the plan is? What is it?

252
00:14:47.804 --> 00:14:49.013
Where is the restroom?

253
00:14:49.097 --> 00:14:51.182
I'll take you there

254
00:14:51.265 --> 00:14:52.975
- This way
- Eat it

255
00:14:53.059 --> 00:14:54.185
I'll be right back

256
00:14:54.936 --> 00:14:56.229
-Brother-in-law, go this way
- OK thank you

257
00:15:02.527 --> 00:15:06.364
I heard from your sister that you wanted to ask me to work before?

258
00:15:08.491 --> 00:15:09.575
Yes

259
00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:14.247
The timing didn't seem right at the time.

260
00:15:15.581 --> 00:15:17.458
Are you interested now?

261
00:15:18.126 --> 00:15:21.671
Didn’t you say you’ve already hired someone?

262
00:15:21.754 --> 00:15:24.507
The more people doing sales, the better.

263
00:15:25.133 --> 00:15:26.926
Really?

264
00:15:34.475 --> 00:15:37.520
But if you decide to join us

265
00:15:37.603 --> 00:15:41.941
You may have to work under a senior for a while first

266
00:15:42.692 --> 00:15:43.568
What then?

267
00:15:43.651 --> 00:15:45.987
In that case, I might not be able to give it.

268
00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:47.864
The treatment I originally wanted to give you

269
00:15:47.947 --> 00:15:49.866
Why, are you going to give me 2 million won?

270
00:15:49.949 --> 00:15:53.077
Oh my God, brother-in-law, of course not

271
00:15:53.161 --> 00:15:54.912
What's wrong? 2 million is okay, right?

272
00:15:54.996 --> 00:15:59.208
I have to give you at least 2.2 million or 2.3 million won

273
00:15:59.292 --> 00:16:02.753
Brother-in-law, I sincerely want to invite you to our company

274
00:16:04.046 --> 00:16:05.173
wait a moment

275
00:16:05.756 --> 00:16:06.757
Hello Director Yan

276
00:16:06.841 --> 00:16:07.800
Well, it's convenient for me to talk

277
00:16:07.884 --> 00:16:09.218
see you later

278
00:16:11.053 --> 00:16:12.430
Yes I saw it

279
00:16:12.513 --> 00:16:14.015
What else do investors want?

280
00:16:14.098 --> 00:16:15.224
Investor Relations What else?

281
00:16:16.392 --> 00:16:18.019
This bastard...

282
00:16:20.313 --> 00:16:21.189
hey

283
00:16:23.316 --> 00:16:25.485
- I don't know...
- Wait, let me talk first.

284
00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:27.695
I'm just saying this just in case

285
00:16:27.778 --> 00:16:30.281
There is no shortage of people in his company now.

286
00:16:31.365 --> 00:16:33.367
I don't want you to get your hopes up too high

287
00:16:34.118 --> 00:16:37.788
The invitation was a few months ago
My brother-in-law said he wasn't interested at the time.

288
00:16:38.456 --> 00:16:39.916
There's no chance now

289
00:16:44.045 --> 00:16:47.131
Don't tell me you asked me out today
Just for this

290
00:16:47.757 --> 00:16:49.133
No, of course not

291
00:16:49.217 --> 00:16:50.927
Of course not, right?

292
00:16:51.552 --> 00:16:53.221
I was almost disappointed

293
00:16:54.055 --> 00:16:58.267
The aloof Park Ha-jin

294
00:16:58.351 --> 00:17:00.937
She would definitely not ask me to help her husband find a job.

295
00:17:01.521 --> 00:17:02.438
How is it possible

296
00:17:03.981 --> 00:17:06.192
- Hello!
- I remembered

297
00:17:06.275 --> 00:17:08.152
I heard that the director’s subordinates

298
00:17:08.236 --> 00:17:10.029
It seems true

299
00:17:10.112 --> 00:17:14.659
We still need to recruit one more person.

300
00:17:30.341 --> 00:17:32.385
It's my first time now

301
00:17:33.094 --> 00:17:36.597
experienced a
The feeling of being able to hold you tight

302
00:17:38.474 --> 00:17:39.934
- Really?
- Yeah

303
00:17:40.768 --> 00:17:43.521
The sister who nags her all the time like her mother

304
00:17:43.604 --> 00:17:48.067
Now because of my husband’s work
tremble before me

305
00:17:51.862 --> 00:17:53.030
hey

306
00:17:53.114 --> 00:17:54.448
Isn’t Sang Cheol back yet?

307
00:17:54.532 --> 00:17:55.533
He came out first

308
00:17:56.117 --> 00:17:58.327
Brother-in-law! Be nice to my sister

309
00:17:58.411 --> 00:17:59.620
I've always been nice to her

310
00:18:00.413 --> 00:18:03.040
My sister really loves you

311
00:18:03.583 --> 00:18:05.042
- OK
- Okay, just do it.

312
00:18:06.294 --> 00:18:08.671
Okay, I understand. Thank you for your hard work.

313
00:18:09.922 --> 00:18:11.299
Who were you calling just now?

314
00:18:11.382 --> 00:18:13.009
Director Yan

315
00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:16.554
Is he someone hired to take the brother-in-law's place?

316
00:18:16.637 --> 00:18:17.638
Yes

317
00:18:22.226 --> 00:18:25.146
So is there a place for him now?

318
00:18:25.229 --> 00:18:28.399
Ouch, I really hope my brother-in-law can join us.

319
00:18:29.692 --> 00:18:33.279
Brother-in-law, please consider my proposal.

320
00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:40.119
What a good wife

321
00:18:40.202 --> 00:18:41.329
What?

322
00:18:41.412 --> 00:18:42.330
nothing

323
00:19:06.979 --> 00:19:10.441
Our happy Ha Young

324
00:19:14.070 --> 00:19:16.405
Please consider it carefully

325
00:19:17.615 --> 00:19:20.576
I promise not to nag you like mom again

326
00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:22.203
I will treat you well, okay?

327
00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:25.915
Please

328
00:19:26.791 --> 00:19:27.750
good

329
00:19:30.628 --> 00:19:32.630
- Stop drinking.
- It's okay

330
00:19:42.306 --> 00:19:43.766
are you okay?

331
00:19:45.893 --> 00:19:48.813
What about you? Are you okay?

332
00:19:50.189 --> 00:19:52.316
I'm fine. What can happen to me?

333
00:19:53.109 --> 00:19:55.152
Then I'm fine

334
00:20:09.583 --> 00:20:11.043
(Representative of Sol Energy Technology, Cho Yunhyung)

335
00:20:11.669 --> 00:20:14.213
Has your company's sales manager resigned?

336
00:20:15.214 --> 00:20:17.466
I'll keep in touch bye

337
00:20:17.550 --> 00:20:19.301
Nothing happens

338
00:20:20.052 --> 00:20:23.055
Didn't you say before that the head of the department resigned?

339
00:20:23.848 --> 00:20:25.850
Damn it’s so hard

340
00:20:25.933 --> 00:20:27.268
(Representative of Sol Energy Technology, Cho Yunhyung)

341
00:20:27.393 --> 00:20:31.272
You complained about them back then
Said they were terrible at their jobs

342
00:20:31.355 --> 00:20:33.357
I also like drinking with you the most

343
00:20:33.441 --> 00:20:34.400
When shall we meet?

344
00:20:34.483 --> 00:20:37.486
Do you want me to come over?
Can you teach me point-of-sales tips?

345
00:20:38.028 --> 00:20:40.281
Okay, you came just in time

346
00:20:40.781 --> 00:20:43.409
I want to open a new branch

347
00:20:43.492 --> 00:20:46.203
If someone like Minister Kim were in charge
I feel more at ease

348
00:20:46.287 --> 00:20:48.497
Branch? Where is it?

349
00:20:49.457 --> 00:20:50.332
(Representing Jinlun Association)

350
00:20:50.416 --> 00:20:51.417
In Jamsil

351
00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:55.171
I plan to make one
One-stop center from experience to sales

352
00:20:56.005 --> 00:20:58.466
This is definitely the retail trend today

353
00:20:59.759 --> 00:21:01.469
You have such a good eye

354
00:21:01.969 --> 00:21:04.430
If you continue to mix in plain words and honorifics like this,

355
00:21:04.513 --> 00:21:05.639
Let's stop talking

356
00:21:10.269 --> 00:21:11.437
You go on.

357
00:21:13.272 --> 00:21:17.318
The basic salary is two per month, and the rest is based on commission.

358
00:21:18.611 --> 00:21:20.196
Two?

359
00:21:21.405 --> 00:21:22.490
Not 20 million

360
00:21:25.326 --> 00:21:26.243
{\an8}(Representative Jang Min-kyu)

361
00:21:26.327 --> 00:21:27.912
{\an8}The most I can give is 2 million

362
00:21:27.995 --> 00:21:29.246
2.2 million won

363
00:21:29.997 --> 00:21:31.248
before tax

364
00:21:31.332 --> 00:21:33.667
- We can't afford to hire people right now.
- Got it

365
00:21:33.751 --> 00:21:35.753
You were born in 1972

366
00:21:35.836 --> 00:21:37.213
- Which university did you attend in 1991?
- Right

367
00:21:37.296 --> 00:21:38.172
Got it

368
00:21:39.882 --> 00:21:41.926
Our representative was born in 1976

369
00:21:42.009 --> 00:21:44.011
Sales! It’s so important

370
00:21:44.094 --> 00:21:47.097
So I personally run the business of our company.

371
00:21:47.723 --> 00:21:50.184
Wow, can you work overtime on weekends?

372
00:21:50.267 --> 00:21:52.520
- Right
- Awesome!

373
00:21:52.603 --> 00:21:53.979
In that case...

374
00:21:54.605 --> 00:21:55.940
2 million

375
00:21:59.026 --> 00:22:02.112
Aren’t sales base salaries very low?
It's all based on commission

376
00:22:02.196 --> 00:22:03.948
But this is too low!

377
00:22:04.031 --> 00:22:05.866
I was the director of a large company last week

378
00:22:05.950 --> 00:22:07.827
I can't work with such a small salary.

379
00:22:08.994 --> 00:22:11.664
Even the monthly salary of a convenience store delivery driver
Already 5 million

380
00:22:11.747 --> 00:22:12.748
Then go do that

381
00:22:13.415 --> 00:22:14.875
I don't have a truck license

382
00:22:16.627 --> 00:22:17.586
Yes, that's true

383
00:22:18.128 --> 00:22:20.965
Then just continue to live off your retirement pay.

384
00:22:21.048 --> 00:22:22.466
please

385
00:22:26.762 --> 00:22:28.639
How do you live?

386
00:22:29.306 --> 00:22:30.224
What do you mean?

387
00:22:30.307 --> 00:22:31.767
What do you do every day?

388
00:22:33.227 --> 00:22:36.105
after i get up in the morning

389
00:22:36.188 --> 00:22:39.233
Go exercise first, then go home and take a shower

390
00:22:39.316 --> 00:22:42.027
Read the newspaper and have dinner with my wife

391
00:22:42.111 --> 00:22:42.987
cut

392
00:22:43.070 --> 00:22:44.697
Eat out occasionally

393
00:22:44.780 --> 00:22:46.782
Then on the way home, I stopped by to take a look at my building.

394
00:22:46.866 --> 00:22:48.033
Sometimes I go hiking

395
00:22:48.117 --> 00:22:49.535
That's pretty much it

396
00:22:49.618 --> 00:22:52.663
That’s great. A person with a monthly income of 30 million
The life we lead is indeed different

397
00:22:52.746 --> 00:22:55.624
Didn’t I tell you? It’s 32 million now

398
00:22:55.708 --> 00:22:58.085
I still have shares in the cafe

399
00:23:02.006 --> 00:23:03.299
(32 million won per month)

400
00:23:04.049 --> 00:23:05.718
I'm so envious of you, Mr. Charterer

401
00:23:11.181 --> 00:23:12.141
Don't do it

402
00:23:12.808 --> 00:23:14.268
What not to do?

403
00:23:14.351 --> 00:23:15.311
no matter what

404
00:23:15.394 --> 00:23:18.022
Never do that thing you are thinking about right now.

405
00:23:18.105 --> 00:23:19.064
stop immediately

406
00:23:20.399 --> 00:23:22.401
Never touch your severance pay

407
00:23:22.484 --> 00:23:23.819
Leave it alone

408
00:23:23.903 --> 00:23:26.238
If a person insists on doing something that is not suitable for him

409
00:23:26.322 --> 00:23:27.573
It will break down the body

410
00:23:28.198 --> 00:23:30.200
Find a job now

411
00:23:30.284 --> 00:23:32.369
You were born to work

412
00:23:38.125 --> 00:23:39.710
(NTC credit card
1,687,150 won has been deducted successfully)

413
00:23:39.793 --> 00:23:41.170
Alas, the credit card was charged again

414
00:23:41.754 --> 00:23:44.173
You can't spend money like you did when you were at work.

415
00:23:44.256 --> 00:23:46.091
You have to save some flowers

416
00:23:46.175 --> 00:23:48.177
Hello, I treat you today

417
00:23:48.761 --> 00:23:50.095
So listen to me talk a few more words

418
00:23:50.971 --> 00:23:53.641
Canned yellow peaches, smoked chicken legs
And spicy beef jerky, right?

419
00:23:54.350 --> 00:23:55.476
Thank you, charterer

420
00:23:55.559 --> 00:23:57.311
Some more dried fish

421
00:23:57.895 --> 00:23:59.647
Ouch, you have a great appetite

422
00:24:05.361 --> 00:24:06.737
thank you take care

423
00:24:09.823 --> 00:24:11.533
(Recruiting delivery driver with a monthly salary of 5 million won)

424
00:24:11.659 --> 00:24:14.912
Convenience store delivery driver makes $5 million

425
00:24:17.414 --> 00:24:19.458
Courier earns 3.5 million

426
00:24:23.212 --> 00:24:26.507
Drivers earn about 4 million

427
00:24:28.842 --> 00:24:32.930
The pension is about 6 million

428
00:24:33.889 --> 00:24:36.642
Golf instructor makes $7 million

429
00:24:38.143 --> 00:24:42.064
6 million, 7 million, 6...

430
00:24:42.147 --> 00:24:43.107
Hello, gentlemen.

431
00:24:43.190 --> 00:24:45.776
We would like to introduce to you two
A very nice commercial building

432
00:24:45.859 --> 00:24:47.403
(The monthly salary will be cut off and the monthly rent will not be)

433
00:24:48.862 --> 00:24:50.155
If you invest now

434
00:24:50.239 --> 00:24:52.491
You can collect six to seven million won in monthly rent in the future

435
00:24:58.414 --> 00:25:00.165
Hey, I'm going home. Let's chat another time.

436
00:25:00.249 --> 00:25:02.251
- Sorry
- Hey Luo Su!

437
00:25:02.334 --> 00:25:03.419
Where are you going?

438
00:25:03.919 --> 00:25:04.962
Hello!

439
00:25:32.990 --> 00:25:35.409
(The monthly salary will be cut off and the monthly rent will not be)

440
00:25:39.621 --> 00:25:42.207
Our store here is still selling it

441
00:25:42.291 --> 00:25:44.543
But you have to come here as soon as possible

442
00:25:44.626 --> 00:25:46.712
Not much left now

443
00:25:46.795 --> 00:25:47.713
Please get a leaflet

444
00:25:47.796 --> 00:25:49.173
- thank you
- thank you

445
00:25:49.923 --> 00:25:51.592
Please get a fan

446
00:25:51.675 --> 00:25:53.260
You can go in and have a consultation.

447
00:25:54.053 --> 00:25:55.554
Did you know?

448
00:25:55.637 --> 00:25:56.722
The monthly salary will be cut off...

449
00:25:56.805 --> 00:25:58.390
- No monthly rent!
- No monthly rent!

450
00:25:59.058 --> 00:26:00.684
- Please go in and have a look.
- thank you

451
00:26:00.768 --> 00:26:02.269
- thank you
- Please come in

452
00:26:02.352 --> 00:26:03.771
Yes, you can go in directly

453
00:26:03.854 --> 00:26:04.772
(Model room shop is for sale)

454
00:26:04.855 --> 00:26:06.607
- Please come and take a look
- You can just take a look at it

455
00:26:06.690 --> 00:26:08.150
Hello, take a fan

456
00:26:08.233 --> 00:26:09.818
I'm also looking forward to working with you

457
00:26:10.444 --> 00:26:13.489
Hello, welcome to AP Royal. Do you have an appointment?

458
00:26:13.989 --> 00:26:15.532
No, I just came over to take a look

459
00:26:15.616 --> 00:26:16.950
Welcome boss

460
00:26:18.118 --> 00:26:20.579
- Have you called to make an appointment?
- No

461
00:26:20.662 --> 00:26:23.248
Sorry
Our consultation appointments are fully booked today

462
00:26:23.332 --> 00:26:25.250
How long until the next appointment?

463
00:26:25.334 --> 00:26:26.710
About 15 minutes?

464
00:26:26.794 --> 00:26:30.089
Boss, I'm afraid I only have about 15 minutes

465
00:26:30.172 --> 00:26:32.341
- Do you think it will work?
- OK

466
00:26:33.842 --> 00:26:34.843
Please come here

467
00:26:38.972 --> 00:26:40.724
(AP Royal Wangzhen Shopping Center Sales Office)

468
00:26:45.938 --> 00:26:48.899
Beverages include coffee, green tea, Shuanghe soup, and coix tea

469
00:26:48.982 --> 00:26:50.609
What would you like to drink?

470
00:26:50.692 --> 00:26:52.319
Just a cup of hot coffee

471
00:26:52.402 --> 00:26:53.904
Have a cup of hot coffee

472
00:26:53.987 --> 00:26:54.947
Good

473
00:26:56.657 --> 00:26:59.368
Why did you want to come to us today?

474
00:27:00.369 --> 00:27:01.912
You really don’t remember me?

475
00:27:01.995 --> 00:27:04.373
You gave me a flyer at a convenience store before

476
00:27:05.374 --> 00:27:08.001
Yes, yes, I remembered

477
00:27:08.085 --> 00:27:09.753
What a fate

478
00:27:10.420 --> 00:27:11.797
Have you sold it?

479
00:27:12.339 --> 00:27:14.341
These seem to be sold out

480
00:27:14.424 --> 00:27:15.843
You're late, boss.

481
00:27:15.926 --> 00:27:19.638
Now there is only one house left that I can show you.

482
00:27:20.389 --> 00:27:22.266
That set is really good

483
00:27:22.349 --> 00:27:25.144
But the price is a bit high. I’m embarrassed to recommend it.

484
00:27:25.936 --> 00:27:28.021
Listen to it. You said you are pressed for time.

485
00:27:28.105 --> 00:27:30.899
Okay, let me give you a brief introduction.

486
00:27:30.983 --> 00:27:32.025
(Wangzhen Shopping Center)

487
00:27:32.109 --> 00:27:35.112
First of all, the location of this shop is very good

488
00:27:35.195 --> 00:27:38.740
No need to talk about this part
I’ve seen the news about the extension of Line 5

489
00:27:38.824 --> 00:27:40.367
Then I will add something

490
00:27:40.450 --> 00:27:43.912
Yesterday I walked from the subway entrance to the shop in person

491
00:27:43.996 --> 00:27:46.415
We have always advertised that it is a five-minute walk

492
00:27:46.498 --> 00:27:49.001
Guess what? It’s just a three-minute walk.

493
00:27:49.084 --> 00:27:52.087
People who sell houses always say it’s “very close” to the subway station.

494
00:27:52.171 --> 00:27:53.547
It's really only a three-minute walk away.

495
00:27:54.298 --> 00:27:56.758
That doesn't make any sense. It only works if there is a large flow of people.

496
00:27:56.842 --> 00:27:59.887
There is huge potential for business development here

497
00:27:59.970 --> 00:28:03.140
Look at this
The headquarters of a large IT company is to be built nearby

498
00:28:03.223 --> 00:28:04.558
Project has been approved

499
00:28:04.641 --> 00:28:07.019
Almost all the 50,000 residents in the surrounding communities have moved in.

500
00:28:07.102 --> 00:28:08.437
There are schools nearby

501
00:28:09.730 --> 00:28:13.525
so i think
Traffic flow and crowd quality here

502
00:28:14.151 --> 00:28:15.611
Almost comparable to Gangnam Station

503
00:28:15.694 --> 00:28:18.780
Gangnam Station? That’s too exaggerated.

504
00:28:18.864 --> 00:28:21.617
- Boss, I am a professional
- Right

505
00:28:22.284 --> 00:28:25.871
I have been in business for so many years
This location is definitely one of the best.

506
00:28:25.954 --> 00:28:28.540
But compared to Gangnam Station...

507
00:28:29.041 --> 00:28:29.917
thank you

508
00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:31.585
- your coffee
- thank you

509
00:28:31.668 --> 00:28:34.213
It turns out it’s a good school district.

510
00:28:35.255 --> 00:28:36.924
So which stores are there now?

511
00:28:37.007 --> 00:28:38.717
Please look at the first floor

512
00:28:38.800 --> 00:28:40.969
A restaurant chain and a large drugstore have signed up

513
00:28:41.053 --> 00:28:44.514
The second to fifth floors are clinics
Dentistry, Psychiatry, Paediatrics, Dermatology

514
00:28:44.598 --> 00:28:46.308
Interior decoration will begin soon

515
00:28:46.975 --> 00:28:47.976
The basement is still empty

516
00:28:48.060 --> 00:28:49.603
There is a well-known Internet celebrity who wants to be on the underground floor

517
00:28:49.686 --> 00:28:52.397
Open a large indoor golf club

518
00:28:53.523 --> 00:28:56.652
Come and take a look at the overall layout

519
00:28:56.735 --> 00:28:58.111
Still missing a business format

520
00:28:58.195 --> 00:28:59.613
What do you think?

521
00:28:59.696 --> 00:29:02.574
Well...

522
00:29:02.658 --> 00:29:05.160
Boss, let me give you a tip.

523
00:29:05.244 --> 00:29:06.536
- OK
- here

524
00:29:06.620 --> 00:29:07.579
(chain restaurant)

525
00:29:07.663 --> 00:29:09.957
You come out from the restaurant after eating...

526
00:29:10.749 --> 00:29:13.752
Oh, coffee. There's no cafe.

527
00:29:13.835 --> 00:29:14.711
You react so quickly

528
00:29:14.795 --> 00:29:17.464
Now we are in harmony
Five chain coffee brands are in talks

529
00:29:18.006 --> 00:29:20.175
They all think this position is inevitable

530
00:29:20.259 --> 00:29:21.134
Which ones are they?

531
00:29:21.927 --> 00:29:24.763
The competition is too fierce for me to disclose.

532
00:29:27.307 --> 00:29:28.809
