00:55:50.472 --> 00:55:51.974
No. I have something to tell you.

1071
00:55:52.724 --> 00:55:55.978
On a day like this, you have to go to a good place
leave lasting memories

1072
00:55:58.814 --> 00:56:00.274
Have you found a job?

1073
00:56:01.191 --> 00:56:02.401
I'll tell you later

1074
00:56:03.360 --> 00:56:04.236
Hey, it’s this guy again

1075
00:56:04.319 --> 00:56:05.404
(missed call lazy guy)

1076
00:56:05.487 --> 00:56:06.488
Why does he keep calling?

1077
00:56:08.240 --> 00:56:09.616
That's good news, right?

1078
00:56:10.993 --> 00:56:11.952
I'll tell you later

1079
00:56:18.542 --> 00:56:20.377
I'm leaving. See you later.

1080
00:56:27.384 --> 00:56:28.427
(Bangui Real Estate Agency)

1081
00:56:28.510 --> 00:56:29.511
Hello

1082
00:56:29.595 --> 00:56:31.054
- Please come in
- Hello

1083
00:56:31.138 --> 00:56:32.180
good morning

1084
00:56:32.264 --> 00:56:33.932
- good morning
- Hi

1085
00:56:37.102 --> 00:56:38.687
(information)

1086
00:56:38.770 --> 00:56:39.646
(lazy guy)

1087
00:56:39.730 --> 00:56:40.898
(...scams targeting retirees)

1088
00:56:40.981 --> 00:56:42.733
I've been thinking about it for several days, but I still have to tell you.

1089
00:56:44.026 --> 00:56:47.237
Don't think about unreliable things, please, my friend.

1090
00:56:52.743 --> 00:56:55.037
Call the store sales manager

1091
00:56:55.120 --> 00:56:56.455
(Director of Store Sales Office)

1092
00:56:56.538 --> 00:56:58.916
The number you dialed is unavailable

1093
00:56:59.499 --> 00:57:01.585
Please check before calling...

1094
00:57:04.087 --> 00:57:06.131
Call the store sales manager

1095
00:57:07.257 --> 00:57:09.885
The number you dialed is unavailable

1096
00:57:10.469 --> 00:57:12.846
Please check before dialing

1097
00:57:13.555 --> 00:57:14.806
The one you dialed...

1098
00:57:14.890 --> 00:57:16.975
Call the toast shop owner

1099
00:57:17.809 --> 00:57:21.730
(Call the toast shop owner)

1100
00:57:24.232 --> 00:57:25.484
(Toast shop owner)

1101
00:57:25.567 --> 00:57:26.610
Hello?

1102
00:57:27.152 --> 00:57:29.780
Hello, I am the landlord

1103
00:57:30.572 --> 00:57:32.991
When are you going to start decorating?

1104
00:57:33.492 --> 00:57:34.368
Ah...

1105
00:57:34.451 --> 00:57:37.621
What should I do? I might not be able to open that store.

1106
00:57:37.704 --> 00:57:40.040
What? What are you talking about?

1107
00:57:40.123 --> 00:57:42.084
We have signed the contract

1108
00:57:42.167 --> 00:57:44.920
I'm very sorry that the store can't open.

1109
00:57:45.003 --> 00:57:47.005
You can't quit suddenly now...

1110
00:57:47.589 --> 00:57:49.591
What about the security deposit?

1111
00:57:50.217 --> 00:57:52.386
Oh, you don’t need to return the deposit.

1112
00:57:52.469 --> 00:57:54.721
- Goodbye
- Hello?

1113
00:58:02.479 --> 00:58:04.523
Call the toast shop owner

1114
00:58:06.108 --> 00:58:08.694
The number you dialed is temporarily unavailable

1115
00:58:08.777 --> 00:58:10.821
Please leave a message after the beep

1116
00:58:15.784 --> 00:58:16.702
(lazy guy)

1117
00:58:16.785 --> 00:58:17.828
(...scams targeting retirees)

1118
00:58:20.539 --> 00:58:23.417
(Revealing policies targeting retirees
income-based real estate fraud)

1119
00:58:24.376 --> 00:58:26.420
(Pressure tactic: pretending to be scarce)

1120
00:58:26.503 --> 00:58:27.921
How long until the next appointment?

1121
00:58:28.005 --> 00:58:29.256
About 15 minutes?

1122
00:58:29.339 --> 00:58:32.509
Boss, I'm afraid I only have about 15 minutes

1123
00:58:32.592 --> 00:58:33.969
Do you think it will work?

1124
00:58:34.052 --> 00:58:35.762
Okay, let me give you a brief introduction.

1125
00:58:35.846 --> 00:58:38.181
- Head of the room
- Ah, is it time?

1126
00:58:38.265 --> 00:58:39.725
Are you on your way?

1127
00:58:39.808 --> 00:58:42.310
No. I will be available to see you after my next appointment.

1128
00:58:42.394 --> 00:58:43.270
The monthly salary will be cut off...

1129
00:58:43.353 --> 00:58:45.105
- No monthly rent!
- No monthly rent!

1130
00:58:45.188 --> 00:58:46.523
The headquarters of a large IT company is to be built nearby

1131
00:58:46.606 --> 00:58:47.899
Project has been approved

1132
00:58:47.983 --> 00:58:51.069
Almost all the 50,000 residents in the surrounding communities have moved in.

1133
00:58:51.153 --> 00:58:52.279
(fictitious location and requirements)

1134
00:58:52.362 --> 00:58:53.822
Including VAT, it’s almost 9.9 million

1135
00:58:53.905 --> 00:58:54.948
(overstated earnings)

1136
00:58:55.032 --> 00:58:56.783
You can just rent it for 10 million a month.

1137
00:59:07.711 --> 00:59:09.796
There are no resale restrictions here.

1138
00:59:09.880 --> 00:59:12.049
Turn around and add an extra 400 million to sell on the market

1139
00:59:12.132 --> 00:59:13.800
Will take action immediately

1140
00:59:13.884 --> 00:59:16.219
You can make 400 million just by sitting down

1141
00:59:19.556 --> 00:59:20.807
Don't tell other owners

1142
00:59:20.891 --> 00:59:23.477
You took a discount of 550 million

1143
00:59:23.560 --> 00:59:24.686
Otherwise we'll be in big trouble

1144
00:59:26.563 --> 00:59:28.356
This is a special discount just for you

1145
00:59:33.278 --> 00:59:35.489
Other owners bought it at the original price.

1146
01:00:01.431 --> 01:00:03.683
Oops, you're here again

1147
01:00:04.434 --> 01:00:07.813
Did something happen to the store opposite?

1148
01:00:07.896 --> 01:00:09.106
Shop?

1149
01:00:09.189 --> 01:00:11.024
Oh, Wangzhen Shopping Center

1150
01:00:11.108 --> 01:00:13.860
The TV station came to film it last week

1151
01:00:13.944 --> 01:00:15.487
Everyone must have seen the content of the program

1152
01:00:15.570 --> 01:00:17.405
I heard that the store could not be sold for even 300 million won.

1153
01:00:17.489 --> 01:00:19.157
They sold more than a billion

1154
01:00:19.241 --> 01:00:20.450
- It's too much
- Oops

1155
01:00:20.534 --> 01:00:23.120
Wait, you didn’t spend one billion to buy the store, right?

1156
01:00:23.203 --> 01:00:26.456
It's a three-minute walk from here
Prime location just to the subway station

1157
01:00:26.540 --> 01:00:29.376
- How could it be worth only 300 million?
- Ouch, what did you say?

1158
01:00:29.459 --> 01:00:31.586
The subway project has been delayed for a long time

1159
01:00:31.670 --> 01:00:34.381
How can it be considered a subway business district if it is not open to traffic?

1160
01:00:34.464 --> 01:00:35.966
It seems like he really doesn't know.

1161
01:00:36.049 --> 01:00:39.636
I didn't expect you to actually sign the contract

1162
01:00:39.719 --> 01:00:42.097
Are the utility bills also borne by you?

1163
01:00:44.266 --> 01:00:45.350
Yeah

1164
01:00:53.650 --> 01:00:56.403
(Sales and Rent Wangzhen Shopping Center Sales Office)

1165
01:01:03.368 --> 01:01:04.578
According to investigation

1166
01:01:04.661 --> 01:01:06.955
The sales office issued an unauthorized development plan

1167
01:01:07.038 --> 01:01:09.666
Inducing customers to sign contracts quickly

1168
01:01:09.749 --> 01:01:13.461
and used a fake list of merchants as bait.
Lure investors into taking the bait

1169
01:01:19.342 --> 01:01:20.844
Help open the door!

1170
01:01:20.927 --> 01:01:22.012
Hurry up!

1171
01:01:51.291 --> 01:01:52.334
(Wangzhen Shopping Center)

1172
01:01:53.919 --> 01:01:54.961
(urgent sale)

1173
01:02:00.884 --> 01:02:02.886
(Urgent sale, one-year short-term rental, super urgent sale)

1174
01:02:04.346 --> 01:02:05.680
(urgent sale office or shop)

1175
01:03:02.070 --> 01:03:05.532
"Minister Kim's Dream Life"

1176
01:03:35.645 --> 01:03:39.190
{\an8}Didn’t I tell you not to touch your severance pay?

1177
01:03:39.274 --> 01:03:42.319
{\an8}Don’t think about carrying it alone
Tell your wife quickly

1178
01:03:42.402 --> 01:03:43.570
{\an8}Are you hiding something from me?

1179
01:03:44.154 --> 01:03:47.032
{\an8}You've been doing weird things lately

1180
01:03:47.115 --> 01:03:48.950
{\an8}It feels like I’m interviewing you, brother-in-law.

1181
01:03:49.743 --> 01:03:51.911
{\an8}If that’s the case

1182
01:03:51.995 --> 01:03:54.080
{\an8}Then I’ll start working today, okay?

1183
01:03:54.956 --> 01:03:57.584
{\an8}Soo Qian, when will you do this?

1184
01:03:57.667 --> 01:04:00.211
{\an8}That circle didn’t protect you.

1185
01:04:00.295 --> 01:04:03.173
{\an8}If you are overwhelmed by debt
Do you know what the consequences will be?

1186
01:04:03.256 --> 01:04:05.383
{\an8}Eventually you will lose yourself

1187
01:04:05.467 --> 01:04:06.801
{\an8}Damn it

1188
01:04:07.677 --> 01:04:09.304
{\an8}Who are you?

1189
01:04:09.387 --> 01:04:10.638
{\an8}Are you...

1190
01:04:10.722 --> 01:04:13.266
{\an8}Fate is such a wonderful thing, isn’t it?

1191
01:04:13.350 --> 01:04:14.768
{\an8}I didn’t expect that we would work together again.

1192
01:04:14.851 --> 01:04:16.853
{\an8}Subtitle translation: Cheng Jiayue

